flowchart TB
  U[Authorized Users / AI OS Agents] --> TLS[HTTPS reverse proxy + WAF]
  TLS --> API[FastAPI Inference API]
  ADM[Private Admin / CI runner] --> CTRL[Release Control API]
  CTRL --> GATE[Accuracy Quality Gate]
  GATE --> REG[(Versioned Model Artifacts + SHA256)]
  GATE --> ALIAS[(Champion / Candidate Aliases)]
  API --> ALIAS
  API --> REG
  API --> PM[Prometheus / Monitoring]
  API --> DB[(PostgreSQL)]
  CTRL --> AUDIT[(Immutable-event audit history)]
  TRAIN[Training + Holdout Evaluation] --> CTRL
  GITHUB[GitHub Actions Test + Image Build] --> DEPLOY[Deployment Approval + Rollback]
  DEPLOY --> TLS
  PROMPT[LLM Prompt/Model Evaluation Extension] -. planned .-> CTRL
